reviewers.description:
The new reminders.ts unconditionally fetches the user and sends a reminder email:

const user = await getUser(userId);
if (!user) throw new Error("User not found");
const message = buildReminder(user);
await sendEmail(user.email, message);

There is no check of the user's notification preferences or opt-out status before building/sending the reminder. This violates requirement REQ-NOTIFY-4, which mandates that users who have opted out of non-essential billing reminders must not receive them.

